/users/jesuino/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesuino","id":359820,"login":"jesuino","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1OTgyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melviz-org/melviz/commits/3ecc256afb3d01a8f4e3bfc8e38bb6b6573d0ca0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T15:55:53Z","email":"william.fatecsjc@gmail.com","name":"William Siqueira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T15:55:53Z","email":"william.fatecsjc@gmail.com","name":"William Siqueira"},"message":"tier3: add explicit dependency declarations for all directly-used artifacts\n\n- melviz-bom: added elemental2-core, elemental2-dom, elemental2-promise,\n  jsinterop-base, jsinterop-annotations to dependencyManagement\n- melviz-displayer-api: added jsinterop-annotations, elemental2-core, base\n- melviz-navigation-api: added elemental2-dom, base\n- uberfire-layout-editor-api: added elemental2-dom\n- melviz-webapp-shared: added slf4j-api, elemental2-dom, errai-common, errai-ui\n- melviz-webapp: added errai-ui, plus all elemental2 and jsinterop deps\n- melviz-common-client: added slf4j-api, elemental2-dom, errai-common, errai-ui\n- melviz-displayer-client: added jsinterop-annotations, elemental2-core, base\n- melviz-displayer-editor: added elemental2-dom, base\n- melviz-navigation-client: added elemental2-dom, base\n- melviz-patternfly: added elemental2-dom, base\n- melviz-renderer-default: added elemental2-dom, base\n- melviz-renderer-echarts: added elemental2-core, elemental2-dom, elemental2-promise,\n  jsinterop-annotations, base, plus melviz-patternfly and errai-common\n- uberfire-runtime-plugins-client: added elemental2-promise, elemental2-dom,\n  jsinterop-annotations, base, plus jakarta.inject-api, errai-common,\n  errai-ioc, errai-ui, uberfire-api, uberfire-layout-editor-api, marked\n\nThis completes the Tier 3 hygiene: every artifact directly used in Java source\nfiles now has an explicit dependency declaration. No transitive-only deps\nshould be referenced in Java code.","tree":{"sha":"af0cf5c8d490e442b52bb8a07546e4a03794f3ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melviz-org/melviz/git/trees/af0cf5c8d490e442b52bb8a07546e4a03794f3ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melviz-org/melviz/git/commits/3ecc256afb3d01a8f4e3bfc8e38bb6b6573d0ca0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/359820?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jesuino","id":359820,"login":"jesuino","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1OTgyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesuino","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/melviz-org/melviz/commit/3ecc256afb3d01a8f4e