zX6LGuRVvv/ahSolUg1gu3/qcMmaTmk9x\nfUPRuFnd59apA0bg/8DcUS/YjeHdijgjRo16v0OjD3jIiCZKFFCOeX7cvL2k3BNx\njKLfCqa6UsSRcmfixU4q2AttoX76PcS1yWD9qJD94UzY4eFYsjS+JWr5ruexeLm3\n2tOvAeHtjHW6NLn2VdgH\n=db9C\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-11T06:43:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commit/80a2b448f44fcec8f35f026e1ce92eed01de13e3","node_id":"C_kwDONm4PJtoAKDgwYTJiNDQ4ZjQ0ZmNlYzhmMzVmMDI2ZTFjZTkyZWVkMDFkZTEzZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commit/4705f4e9586fc79e396a36f955a17f672165130e","sha":"4705f4e9586fc79e396a36f955a17f672165130e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commits/4705f4e9586fc79e396a36f955a17f672165130e"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commit/b7f9f51a91a6c8523e3625390be9cfdb622af5f3","sha":"b7f9f51a91a6c8523e3625390be9cfdb622af5f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commits/b7f9f51a91a6c8523e3625390be9cfdb622af5f3"}],"sha":"80a2b448f44fcec8f35f026e1ce92eed01de13e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commits/80a2b448f44fcec8f35f026e1ce92eed01de13e3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commits/b7f9f51a91a6c8523e3625390be9cfdb622af5f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T05:50:13Z","email":"tudhm@ghn.vn","name":"TuDHM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T06:38:47Z","email":"tudhm@ghn.vn","name":"TuDHM"},"message":"feat(inspector): consume window.__ghnInspector facade with hostname-keyed memory\n\nRefactors the inspector to call the portal-exposed window.__ghnInspector\nfacade instead of poking localStorage directly, and adds cross-environment\noverride memory keyed by hostname in browser.storage.local.\n\n- service-worker.ts: all five commands now route through a new execInPage\n  helper that runs in `world: \"MAIN\"`. The MAIN-world option is required —\n  Chrome MV3''s default ISOLATED world cannot read page-set globals like\n  window.__ghnInspector (only Web APIs like localStorage are shared across\n  worlds).\n- types.ts: adds SET_LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT message command and a\n  PortalInspectorAPI mirror type kept in sync with the portal facade.\n- localStorage.context.tsx: tracks apiAvailable: boolean | null derived\n  from GET_PORTAL_MODULE === null; rewrites get/save/getApp callbacks to\n  read/write hostname-keyed slices of browser.storage.local. On tab focus,\n  the panel restores the saved slice for the active host into that tab''s\n  localStorage so useLoadModule sees the right overrides.\n- ApplicationList.tsx: onReset reads the API-defaults slice for the active\n  tab''s hostname.\n- DevelopmentToggle.tsx (new): checkbox bound to GET_LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT /\n  SET_LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT — user no longer needs the DevTools console to\n  enable dev mode.\n- DevTools.tsx: renders \"Portal API not exposed on this host\" fallback\n  when apiAvailable === false; mounts DevelopmentToggle in the normal\n  render path.\n- panel.css: adds .dev-toggle and .api-missing styles.\n- Bumps version to 1.2.0 in both package.json and source/manifest.json.\n\nType-check, lint, and yarn build clean across chrome/firefox/edge/opera.","tree":{"sha":"9e4f7d1399c4210b07b66c70cdf6b9f6beeb60e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/git/trees/9e4f7d1399c4210b07b66c70cdf6b9f6beeb60e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/git/commits/b7f9f51a91a6c8523e3625390be9cfdb622af5f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commit/b7f9f51a91a6c8523e3625390be9cfdb622af5f3","node_id":"C_kwDONm4PJtoAKGI3ZjlmNTFhOTFhNmM4NTIzZTM2MjUzOTBiZTljZmRiNjIyYWY1ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commit/8ae9d25263db3ec7c94a49bbd86ef577db788b6f","sha":"8ae9d25263db3ec7c94a49bbd86ef577db788b6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commits/8ae9d25263db3ec7c94a49bbd86ef577db788b6f"}],"sha":"b7f9f51a91a6c8523e3625390be9cfdb622af5f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commits/b7f9f51a91a6c8523e3625390be9cfdb622af5f3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commits/8ae9d25263db3ec7c94a49bbd86ef577db788b6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T00:58:05Z","email":"tudhm@ghn.vn","name":"TuDHM"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T00:58:05Z","email":"tudhm@ghn.vn","name":"TuDHM"},"message":"feat(devtools): expand host coverage to ghn.vn and drop dev-mode gate\n\n- manifest: add https://*.ghn.vn/* to Firefox permissions and Chromium\n  host_permissions so the panel can inject scripts on .ghn.vn portals\n  (previously limited to .ghn.tech and localhost).\n- DevTools: remove the isDev / useGlobal gate. The panel no longer\n  requires localStorage[\"ghn_mfe_development\"] === \"true\" on the\n  inspected tab; it activates as soon as a tab URL is resolved. The\n  \"only worked in development environment\" placeholder now triggers\n  solely on missing tab info.\n- LocalStorageProvider: reformat with Biome (tabs, trailing commas,\n  type-only Message import). No behavior change.\n- biome.json: rename from _biome.json so the config is actually picked\n  up by Biome (the underscore prefix disabled it).\n- CLAUDE.md: add repo-root guide covering build commands, the\n  service-worker / devtools / panel three-context architecture, the\n  MessageCommand IPC contract, manifest key-prefix generation, and\n  project conventions for future Claude Code sessions.","tree":{"sha":"525c0cf33883a192d373b7716aa0e6f20f65b9db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/git/trees/525c0cf33883a192d373b7716aa0e6f20f65b9db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/git/commits/8ae9d25263db3ec7c94a49bbd86ef577db788b6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commit/8ae9d25263db3ec7c94a49bbd86ef577db788b6f","node_id":"C_kwDONm4PJtoAKDhhZTlkMjUyNjNkYjNlYzdjOTRhNDliYmQ4NmVmNTc3ZGI3ODhiNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commit/4705f4e9586fc79e396a36f955a17f672165130e","sha":"4705f4e9586fc79e396a36f955a17f672165130e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commits/4705f4e9586fc79e396a36f955a17f672165130e"}],"sha":"8ae9d25263db3ec7c94a49bbd86ef577db788b6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/comehere127/ghn-inspector/commits/8ae9d25263db3ec7c94a49bbd86ef577db788b6f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65916846?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/following{