it":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T13:17:41Z","email":"duzasergej@gmail.com","name":"googlebume"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T13:17:41Z","email":"duzasergej@gmail.com","name":"googlebume"},"message":"refactor(auth-service): rewrite to hexagonal architecture (DDD + SOLID)\n\n- Domain layer: User & OtpSession entities with business logic, port interfaces\n  for all external dependencies (IUserRepository, IOtpSessionRepository,\n  ITokenService, IEmailService, IGoogleAuthService)\n- Application layer: 11 use cases (one per operation, SRP), DTOs moved to\n  application/dto, no framework dependencies in use cases\n- Infrastructure layer: adapters for TCP microservice, in-memory OTP sessions,\n  JWT, Resend mailer, Google OAuth; thin controllers delegate to use cases;\n  @CurrentUser decorator replaces raw @Req(); AuthInfrastructureModule wires all ports\n- Fix: MailerHandler lazy-initialises Resend client to avoid crash on missing key\n- Fix: AuthWithGoogleUseCase returns `user` with `role` field to match frontend contract\n- Fix: UserAuthBlock handles both `roles` and `role` fields from profile response","tree":{"sha":"d9794b6a4a1f2f5f42c374e9ec17e55525a46fa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/googlebume/online-store-fashion/git/trees/d9794b6a4a1f2f5f42c374e9ec17e55525a46fa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/googlebume/online-store-fashion/git/commits/2c767c4db31900eacaca6d31c97afdc9fffcf1da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/187138253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/googlebume/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/googlebume/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/googlebume/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/googlebume/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/googlebume","id":187138253,"login"