et05","id":69012359,"login":"Duvet05","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MDEyMzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Duvet05/esm-sihsalus-app/commits/0061bebdc3b098f06a26b80bae18bad6d80d5387/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-18T06:35:01Z","email":"gonzalo.galvezc@pucp.edu.pe","name":"Gonzalo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-18T06:35:01Z","email":"gonzalo.galvezc@pucp.edu.pe","name":"Gonzalo"},"message":"feat: Implementar sincronización de pacientes Dyaku a OpenMRS\n\nMEJORAS IMPLEMENTADAS:\n- Configuración de URL Dyaku en config schema usando useConfig hook\n- Funcionalidad de sincronización de pacientes desde FHIR Dyaku a OpenMRS\n- Componente DyakuPatientsSync con modal de progreso y manejo de errores\n- Mapeo de datos FHIR a formato OpenMRS para pacientes\n- Verificación de pacientes existentes antes de crear duplicados\n- Actualización automática de la tabla después de sincronización\n- Traducciones completas en español para toda la funcionalidad\n\nCARACTERÍSTICAS TÉCNICAS:\n- useConfig para configuración dinámica de URL base FHIR\n- Funciones de sincronización con manejo de lotes configurable\n- Componente de sincronización con progress bar y notificaciones\n- Estilos responsivos para modal de sincronización\n- Integración completa con Carbon UI y OpenMRS framework\n- Manejo de errores robusto con fallbacks\n\nARCHIVOS MODIFICADOS:\n- src/config-schema.ts: Agregada configuración dyaku\n- src/dyaku-patients/dyaku-patients.resource.ts: Funciones de sincronización\n- src/dyaku-patients/dyaku-patients-sync.component.tsx: Modal de sincronización\n- src/dyaku-patients/dyaku-patients-sync.scss: Estilos del modal\n- src/dyaku-patients/dyaku-patients-table.component.tsx: Botón de sincronización\n- src/dyaku-patients/dyaku-patients-table.scss: Layout del header\n- translations/es.json: Traducciones de sincronización","tree":{"sha":"780eff2cdaba61eead81f223765a8210e39b5bd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Duvet05/esm-sihsalus-app/git/trees/780eff2cdaba61eead81f223765a8210e39b5bd5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Duvet05/esm-sihsalus-app/git/commits/0061bebdc3b098f06a26b80bae18bad6d80d5387","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69012359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Duvet05","id":69012359,"login":"Duvet05","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MDEyMzU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duvet05","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Duvet05/esm-sihsalus-app/commit/0061bebdc3b098f06a26b80bae18bad6d80d5387","node_id":"C_kwDONnrKWNoAKDAwNjFiZWJkYzNiMDk4ZjA2YTI2YjgwYmFlMThiYWQ2ZDgwZDUzODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Duvet05/esm-sihsalus-app/commit/b4a43fc5b325d474fd00a5212b4210aadabe07d7","sha":"b4a43fc5b325d474fd00a5212b4210aadabe07d